{"overview":"سریال انیمیشن بسیار جذاب Family Guy که از سال ۱۹۹۹ پخش اون آغاز شده و تا به حال برنده سه جایزه امی و چندین جایزه دیگه شده. این انیمیشن همانند انیمیشن ساوت پارک بیشتر از آنکه برای کودکان باشه برای بزرگسالان ساخته شده. شخصیت پردازی در این سریال بسیار کار شده و...","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sick, twisted, politically incorrect and Freakin' Sweet animated series featuring the adventures of the dysfunctional Griffin family. Bumbling Peter and long-suffering Lois have three kids. Stewie (a brilliant but sadistic baby bent on killing his mother and taking over the world), Meg (the oldest, and is the most unpopular girl in town) and Chris (the middle kid, he's not very bright but has a passion for movies). The final member of the family is Brian - a talking dog and much more than a pet, he keeps Stewie in check whilst sipping Martinis and sorting through his own life issues.","tagline_en":"Don't die laughing. We could get sued.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":28,"y":1994,"poster":"/tDypnXxoJOAUu6VvFvAAIkwXNXT.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":1999,"poster":"/5E4yhF7TVrr1l8aq7GM6IdLTsrP.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":21,"y":1999,"poster":"/rskVG2RP0Uzamv9zzslYE7TYPdE.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":22,"y":2001,"poster":"/5sK70w0MLNVa7OeJeOqRmSZUUmr.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":30,"y":2005,"poster":"/h6Qv5oONB3yN1MOqru7v0vAGJ6J.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":18,"y":2006,"poster":"/kyfo6OUtCRYCaxFmqQ3kGORCexq.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":12,"y":2007,"poster":"/pvK7pZUyOLcH9zWdydXD01UUTf0.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":16,"y":2008,"poster":"/5GUHJgPxDwh0njN3ytEIBENhmOJ.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":20,"y":2009,"poster":"/kwPaT3INWe36c5B3t7FJFWelm8y.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":18,"y":2010,"poster":"/gi9TE5c1bVTHEN4BmnICX23mlFO.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":23,"y":2011,"poster":"/hD0uA1xMNHsPDovAmgjDowjbctS.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":22,"y":2012,"poster":"/6reQqzBqJ7ObrNF2E